@startuml sequence-learner-onboarding-m23
title SEQ-02: Learner Onboarding & Entry Pathway Choice Flow (UC-02 / UC-03 Offer)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Learner" as Learner
boundary "Web Learner Client\n(SCR-L-02 / SCR-L-03)" as Web
control "Profile Service\n(Route Handler / BFF)" as ProfileSvc
control "Curriculum Service\n(Application Logic)" as CurricSvc
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(PostgREST / RLS)" as DB

== 1. Goal & Time Configuration (UC-02) ==
Learner -> Web: Navigate to Onboarding Goal Setting (/onboarding/goals)
activate Web
Learner -> Web: Select dailyGoalMin (15m default), timezone ("Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"), In-app reminder toggle
note right of Web
    ADR-006: In-app reminder setting is client-local (localStorage/push API),
    NOT persisted as a Profile column.
end note
Web -> ProfileSvc: PATCH /api/learner/profile { dailyGoalMin, timezone }
activate ProfileSvc

alt Validation Failure (dailyGoalMin < 5 or > 120)
    ProfileSvc --> Web: 422 Unprocessable Entity (GOAL_OUT_OF_RANGE)
    Web --> Learner: Show validation error message
else Valid Configuration
    ProfileSvc -> DB: UPDATE "Profile" SET dailyGoalMin, timezone WHERE id = auth.uid()
    activate DB
    DB --> ProfileSvc: Profile updated
    deactivate DB
    ProfileSvc --> Web: 200 OK { updated: true }
    deactivate ProfileSvc
    Web --> Learner: Goals saved -> Present Assessment Pathway Choice (SCR-L-03)
end

== 2. Entry Pathway Choice: Self-Report vs Diagnostic (Decision D4) ==
Learner -> Web: View Pathway Options (SCR-L-03)

alt Pathway A: Self-Report / Skip Diagnostic (Flexible Entry Branch A)
    Learner -> Web: Select "Self-Report Level" or "Skip Test" (e.g. selfReportedLevel = "A1")
    Web -> ProfileSvc: POST /api/learner/entry-path { path: "SELF_REPORT", declaredLevel: "A1" }
    activate ProfileSvc
    ProfileSvc -> CurricSvc: Resolve default starting point for declared level
    activate CurricSvc
    CurricSvc --> ProfileSvc: Return default Starting Unit (Unit 1)
    deactivate CurricSvc

    ProfileSvc -> DB: UPDATE "LearnerProfile" SET\nselfReportedLevel = 'A1',\nverifiedProficiency = 'UNVERIFIED'\nWHERE userId = auth.uid()\n(Candidate starting_unit INT on Profile [DD-06 / OPEN DESIGN])
    activate DB
    DB --> ProfileSvc: LearnerProfile updated
    deactivate DB

    note right of ProfileSvc
        Invariant (E-EXP-01):
        Branch A strictly produces:
        - ZERO AssessmentResult
        - ZERO SkillProfile
        - ZERO verifiedProficiency
        Starting point is provisional.
    end note

    ProfileSvc --> Web: 200 OK { startingUnit: "Unit 1", verified: false }
    deactivate ProfileSvc
    Web --> Learner: Redirect to Learning Path (/learn) at Unit 1

else Pathway B: Accept Stage-Adaptive Diagnostic Assessment (Branch B)
    Learner -> Web: Select "Take Diagnostic Assessment"
    Web -> ProfileSvc: POST /api/learner/entry-path { path: "DIAGNOSTIC" }
    activate ProfileSvc
    ProfileSvc --> Web: 200 OK { action: "START_DIAGNOSTIC", runnerUrl: "/assessment/diagnostic" }
    deactivate ProfileSvc
    Web --> Learner: Redirect to Diagnostic Test Runner (SCR-L-04) -> Initiates SEQ-03
end
deactivate Web

@enduml
